# Review before running

Do not run tests, installs, Docker builds, compose up/down, generation jobs, or other commands that change machine state or spend GPU/CPU time unless the user explicitly asks to run them.

After editing, stop and ask the user to review. List the commands you would run. Wait for approval.

Read-only inspection of existing files is fine. `uv sync`, `pytest`, `docker compose`, `gensvc generate`, and similar are not.
